// Certification badge artwork, base64-embedded, for the edge renderers.
//
// WHY INLINE RATHER THAN FETCHED
//   Deno at the edge cannot read the web repo's public/ directory. The
//   alternatives were a network fetch or a Storage read at render time, and
//   this project has paid twice for render-time external dependencies on these
//   exact functions: esm.sh changed an export shape and boot-failed
//   credential-og (v3.2 s8), and a missing PUBLIC_SITE_URL secret sent both
//   public functions to a dead domain for months (v3.2 s7). ~203 kB of bundle
//   buys the failure mode going away entirely.
//
// WHY BASE64 STRINGS, NOT Uint8Array
//   resvg embeds a raster as <image href="data:image/png;base64,...">. The
//   string is already the wire format. Unlike fonts.ts, nothing here needs
//   b64ToBytes.
//
// KEYED BY certifications.code
//   Not by UUID. trg_guard_cert_identity blocks code mutation on existing rows,
//   so the DB guarantees these keys stable -- which a UUID column does not
//   guarantee any better and reads far worse.
//
// ARTWORK NOTES (true at generation time)
//   501x501 RGBA, true alpha, uniform trim.
//   Header colour is programme-coded (scrum navy / governance aubergine /
//   ai-workplace teal) but the hex drifts between siblings -- a corrected set
//   is expected from design and drops in here with no code change.

